{"name":"Magic Moment","hex":"#757caf","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"magic moment","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The initial experience of a customer in evaluating a product, in which its value or worth is appreciated."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/magic_moment"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cee Lo's Magic Moment","blocks":[{"text":"Cee Lo's Magic Moment is the first Christmas studio album and overall fourth studio album released by American singer Cee Lo Green on October 29, 2012, in the United Kingdom. It was released to the US on October 30 by Elektra Records. Green's versions of \"Mary, Did You Know?\" and \"What Christmas Means to Me\" peaked at numbers 22 and 23 on the December 22, 2012 R&B Songs chart in the United States. The album sold 181,000 copies in the United States in 2012. It is Cee Lo Green's first solo album to not contain a Parental Advisory label."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b8/Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cee_Lo's_Magic_Moment"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b8/Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg/250px-Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b8/Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/b/b8/Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg/250px-Cee_Lo%27s_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACee_Lo's_Magic_Moment_recording_cover.jpg"}],"sounds":{"magic moment":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/w